000010* SORT and MERGE: USING/GIVING, INPUT/OUTPUT PROCEDURE with
000020* RELEASE/RETURN, several keys (ascending and descending),
000030* MERGE of two ordered files, and SORT of a table.
000040 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000050 PROGRAM-ID. SORTS.
000060 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000070 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000080 FILE-CONTROL.
000090     SELECT EMPS ASSIGN TO "emps.txt"
000100        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000110     SELECT SORTED ASSIGN TO "sorted.txt"
000120        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000130     SELECT EAST ASSIGN TO "east.txt"
000140        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000150     SELECT WEST ASSIGN TO "west.txt"
000160        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000170     SELECT MERGED ASSIGN TO "merged.txt"
000180        ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000190     SELECT WORK1 ASSIGN TO "sortwork".
000200 DATA DIVISION.
000210 FILE SECTION.
000220 FD EMPS.
000230 01 EMP-REC        PIC X(24).
000240 FD SORTED.
000250 01 SORTED-REC     PIC X(24).
000260 FD EAST.
000270 01 EAST-REC       PIC X(24).
000280 FD WEST.
000290 01 WEST-REC       PIC X(24).
000300 FD MERGED.
000310 01 MERGED-REC     PIC X(24).
000320 SD WORK1.
000330 01 W-REC.
000340    05 W-NAME      PIC X(10).
000350    05 W-DEPT      PIC X(6).
000360    05 W-PAY       PIC 9(5).
000370    05 FILLER      PIC X(3).
000380 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000390 01 LINE-OUT       PIC X(24).
000400 01 EOF-FLAG       PIC X.
000410    88 AT-EOF      VALUE "Y".
000420 01 HIGH-COUNT           PIC 99 VALUE 0.
000430 01 SCORES.
000440    05 SCORE OCCURS 6.
000450       10 S-NAME   PIC X(5).
000460       10 S-PTS    PIC S9(3) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
000470 01 I              PIC 9.
000480 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000490 MAIN-PARA.
000500     OPEN OUTPUT EMPS
000510     MOVE "SMITH     SALES 04200" TO EMP-REC WRITE EMP-REC
000520     MOVE "JONES     ADMIN 03900" TO EMP-REC WRITE EMP-REC
000530     MOVE "BROWN     SALES 05100" TO EMP-REC WRITE EMP-REC
000540     MOVE "ADAMS     ADMIN 03900" TO EMP-REC WRITE EMP-REC
000550     MOVE "CLARK     IT    06100" TO EMP-REC WRITE EMP-REC
000560     MOVE "DAVIS     SALES 04200" TO EMP-REC WRITE EMP-REC
000570     MOVE "EVANS     IT    05000" TO EMP-REC WRITE EMP-REC
000580     CLOSE EMPS
000590     SORT WORK1 ON ASCENDING KEY W-DEPT
000600                   DESCENDING KEY W-PAY
000610        USING EMPS GIVING SORTED
000620     DISPLAY "SORT-RETURN " SORT-RETURN
000630     OPEN INPUT SORTED
000640     MOVE "N" TO EOF-FLAG
000650     PERFORM UNTIL AT-EOF
000660        READ SORTED AT END SET AT-EOF TO TRUE
000670           NOT AT END DISPLAY "  " SORTED-REC
000680        END-READ
000690     END-PERFORM
000700     CLOSE SORTED
000710     DISPLAY "PROCEDURES, PAY OVER 4000, BY NAME:"
000720     SORT WORK1 ON ASCENDING KEY W-NAME
000730        INPUT PROCEDURE IS PICK-HIGH-PAY
000740        OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS SHOW-SORTED
000750     DISPLAY "  KEPT " HIGH-COUNT
000760     OPEN OUTPUT EAST WEST
000770     MOVE "ALLEN     EAST  00100" TO EAST-REC WRITE EAST-REC
000780     MOVE "BAKER     EAST  00200" TO EAST-REC WRITE EAST-REC
000790     MOVE "CROSS     EAST  00300" TO EAST-REC WRITE EAST-REC
000800     MOVE "ALLEN     WEST  00150" TO WEST-REC WRITE WEST-REC
000810     MOVE "BAKER     WEST  00250" TO WEST-REC WRITE WEST-REC
000820     MOVE "DIXON     WEST  00400" TO WEST-REC WRITE WEST-REC
000830     CLOSE EAST WEST
000840     MERGE WORK1 ON ASCENDING KEY W-NAME
000850        USING EAST WEST GIVING MERGED
000860     OPEN INPUT MERGED
000870     MOVE "N" TO EOF-FLAG
000880     DISPLAY "MERGED:"
000890     PERFORM UNTIL AT-EOF
000900        READ MERGED AT END SET AT-EOF TO TRUE
000910           NOT AT END DISPLAY "  " MERGED-REC
000920        END-READ
000930     END-PERFORM
000940     CLOSE MERGED
000950     MOVE "DELTA+012ALPHA-005GAMMA+120BETA +045OMEGA-100ZETA +033"
000960        TO SCORES
000970     SORT SCORE ON DESCENDING KEY S-PTS
000980     PERFORM SHOW-SCORES
000990     SORT SCORE ON ASCENDING KEY S-NAME
001000     PERFORM SHOW-SCORES
001010     STOP RUN.
001020 PICK-HIGH-PAY.
001030     OPEN INPUT EMPS
001040     MOVE "N" TO EOF-FLAG
001050     PERFORM UNTIL AT-EOF
001060        READ EMPS AT END SET AT-EOF TO TRUE
001070           NOT AT END
001080              IF EMP-REC(17:5) > "04000"
001090                 MOVE EMP-REC TO W-REC
001100                 RELEASE W-REC
001110                 ADD 1 TO HIGH-COUNT
001120              END-IF
001130        END-READ
001140     END-PERFORM
001150     CLOSE EMPS.
001160 SHOW-SORTED.
001170     MOVE "N" TO EOF-FLAG
001180     PERFORM UNTIL AT-EOF
001190        RETURN WORK1 AT END SET AT-EOF TO TRUE
001200           NOT AT END DISPLAY "  " W-NAME W-PAY
001210        END-RETURN
001220     END-PERFORM.
001230 SHOW-SCORES.
001240     MOVE SPACES TO LINE-OUT
001250     PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 6
001260        DISPLAY S-NAME(I) " " S-PTS(I) " " WITH NO ADVANCING
001270     END-PERFORM
001280     DISPLAY " ".
